# ============================================================================
# SECURITY REMINDERS
# ============================================================================
#
# ✅ DO:
# - Store secrets in a password manager (1Password, Bitwarden, LastPass)
# - Use different secrets for dev/staging/production
# - Rotate secrets every 90 days
# - Delete .secrets.local after copying to Supabase
# - Use strong, unique passwords
#
# ❌ DON'T:
# - Commit .secrets.local to Git
# - Share secrets via email, Slack, or text
# - Screenshot secrets
# - Store secrets in plain text long-term
# - Reuse passwords across environments
# - Share admin password with unauthorized users
